translate czech wine_gift_e30b4844:

    # robin "Maybe a few more sips wouldn't hurt."
    robin "Možná by neuškodilo ještě pár doušků."

# game/screens/gifts.rpy:1123
translate czech wine_gift_4e709a26:

    # "A few hours pass and 'a few sips' turned into a few more glasses, until the entire bottle was almost finished and it's pitch black outside."
    "Uběhlo několik hodin a „pár doušků“ se proměnilo v pár dalších sklenic, až byla celá láhev téměř hotová a venku byla tma jako v čertu."

